      en: ["Donkeys were the primary transport for salt until the mid-20th century.", "Maio Island covers a total land area of approximately 269 square kilometers.", "The sanctuary focuses on rescuing abandoned and elderly animals.", "Maio donkeys are uniquely adapted to the island's extremely dry climate.", "Visitors can participate in sponsorship programs for individual animals.", "The facility promotes sustainable land use through managed grazing."],
