      en: ["Brava is the smallest inhabited island in Cape Verde at 67 km².", "Queijo de Brava is produced daily from fresh, raw goat's milk.", "Goats were first introduced to the island by the Portuguese in the 1500s.", "The animals graze on wild herbs, which flavors the artisanal cheese.", "Cheese-making is traditionally a role held by women on the farms.", "Fajã d'Água is one of the primary hubs for goat farming on the island."],
