      en: "The children's playground in Espargos, the capital of Sal island, is a crucial social hub for families and the local community. The area has been modernized to provide a safe and engaging space for physical activity within an urban environment otherwise characterized by an arid desert climate. The play equipment meets international safety standards and is specifically designed to cater to the needs of different age groups, from toddlers to older school children. In addition to traditional swings and slides, the park features shaded seating areas, which are indispensable under the intense midday sun of Cape Verde. The park serves not only for recreation but also facilitates integration and social interaction among the residents of Espargos. Maintenance of the facility is handled by the local municipal government, with a strong emphasis on cleanliness and the functionality of the equipment. During the evening hours, the area is well-lit by modern lighting systems, making it a lively center for urban life. Local community events are frequently held here, strengthening social ties and providing children with a protected environment for their development.",
      es: "El Espargos Children's Playground es un parque infantil público en la capital de la isla de Sal, Espargos. Ofrece juegos para niños de diversas edades, incluyendo columpios, toboganes und estructuras para trepar. El parque es un punto de encuentro popular para las familias und fomenta la interacción social und la actividad física. La instalación fue renovada en 2019 und es de acceso gratuito durante el día.",
      pt: "O Espargos Children's Playground é um parque infantil público na capital da ilha do Sal, Espargos. Oferece equipamentos lúdicos para crianças de diversas idades, incluindo baloiços, escorregas e estruturas de escalada. O parque é um ponto de encontro popular para famílias e promove a interação social e a atividade física. A instalação foi renovada em 2019 e tem acesso gratuito durante o dia.",
      fr: "L'Espargos Children's Playground est une aire de jeux publique située dans la capitale de l'île de Sal, Espargos. Il propose des équipements de jeux pour les enfants de différents âges, notamment des balançoires, des toboggans et des structures d'escalade. Le parc est un lieu de rencontre populaire pour les familles et favorise l'interaction sociale et l'activité physique. L'installation a été rénovée en 2019 et est accessible gratuitement pendant la journée.",
